{
  "version": 1,
  "about": "Which subject documents a ship role reads beside the always-read core. The rule is the union of what the plan's surfaces select, what every changed or planned path selects and the cross-cutting additions; an unknown surface, an unmapped path or an empty scope selects every reference (the conservative fallback). Read by tools/ship_efficiency.py; pinned by host/tests/test_ship_context.py. The map chooses documents, never paragraphs: a selected document is read whole.",
